/// Comparison is lexical — `policy_version` is ISO-8601 (`"YYYY-MM-DD"`)
/// which sorts the same way chronologically. We only prompt when the
/// landlord's accepted version is strictly older; a forward-dated row
/// (possible after a deliberate server rollback) is trusted.
/// Exit demo mode cleanly: drop the demo flag, store and mock session, AND
/// every app-store field the demo populated. Leaving `vacancies` as
/// `Success(demo data)` would leak the fake vacancies onto a real landlord's
/// dashboard after demo-exit -> signup (the dashboard refetch gates on
/// NotAsked, so stale Success is never overwritten).
